                <tr><th scope="row">Blog posts, live-session pages and daily devotional posts</th><td data-label="What Brother Aaron does">Writes or approves each one</td><td data-label="What the SCRIBE does">Drafts devotional posts from published pages only; prepares presentation layouts</td></tr>
