                <tr><th scope="row">Check-and-balance team</th><td data-label="Tools">Grok, Gemini, ChatGPT</td><td data-label="What they do here">Test the author's own reasoning: find gaps in his knowledge, advise on interfaith communication, mine scripture for thematic passages, check etymologies and history, flag his own biases, role-play live chat participants so he can practice, and give layered editorial reviews of his rough drafts. Where they disagree is often the most useful result</td></tr>
